            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 3,
              "heading": "Software & Updates"
            },
            "text": "Velvera smartphones run on VelveraOS, a secure, AI-enhanced, and privacy-respecting operating system optimized for performance and longevity. Software support and feature availability vary by series to best match user needs — whether you're a power user, gamer, student, or first-time smartphone owner."
